        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>八款最好喝的梅酒</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background: #4a5a72;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  .poster {\n    max-width: 560px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #f3ecd8;\n    border: 3px solid #7a1f1f;\n    padding: 14px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .header {\n    background: #7a1f1f;\n    color: #f3ecd8;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 14px 6px 8px;\n    border: 1px solid #f3ecd8;\n  }\n  .header h1 {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 26px;\n    letter-spacing: 6px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .subtitle {\n    background: #f3ecd8;\n    color: #7a1f1f;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 8px;\n    padding: 6px 0;\n    margin: 8px 10px 12px 10px;\n    border: 1px solid #7a1f1f;\n  }\n  .grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 6px 10px;\n    border-top: 1px dashed #7a1f1f;\n    padding-top: 8px;\n  }\n  .item {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 8px;\n    padding: 8px 4px;\n    border-bottom: 1px dashed #c9b98a;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    flex: 0 0 60px;\n    width: 60px;\n    height: 100px;\n    background: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #ddd, #ddd 4px, #eee 4px, #eee 8px);\n    border: 1px solid #999;\n    font-size: 8px;\n    color: #555;\n    text-align: center;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 2px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .text-block {\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n  .text-block h3 {\n    margin: 0 0 4px 0;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #7a1f1f;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #7a1f1f;\n    display: inline-block;\n    padding-bottom: 1px;\n  }\n  .text-block p {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: #333;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"poster\">\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <h1>八款最好喝的梅酒</h1>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"subtitle\">女 生 微 醺 必 备 酒 款</div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid\">\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[瓶: 山崎梅酒樽仕入 深色瓶身]</div>\n      <div class=\"text-block\">\n        <h3>山崎梅酒樽仕入</h3>\n        <p>山崎入门级梅酒，也是最经典的一款，口感也是接受度最高的一款。目前已经停产，市场上存量越来越少，想喝或者想收藏小伙伴可以尽快尝试一下。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[瓶: 山崎梅酒樽酿 浅色瓶身]</div>\n      <div class=\"text-block\">\n        <h3>山崎梅酒樽酿</h3>\n        <p>代替樽仕入经典款的新产品，与经典款相同的是，都是使用白兰地作为基酒，但是新款的酒精提到了20度，相比经典款香味与烟熏味道更重一些。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[瓶: 俏雅黑金本格 CHOYA]</div>\n      <div class=\"text-block\">\n        <h3>俏雅黑金本格</h3>\n        <p>这是一款白兰地本格梅酒，所以品尝起来会感觉浮酒的味道浓厚一些，可以搭配气泡水一起饮用，口感会更顺滑。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[瓶: 杂贺纪州梅酒]</div>\n      <div class=\"text-block\">\n        <h3>杂贺纪州梅酒</h3>\n        <p>闻名遐迩的杂贺清酒为酒庄，放入梅子加以浸泡，最后再放入美味的梅子酱，口感浓稠甘甜，而青梅的酸度对健康多有益处。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[瓶: 三得利梅酒]</div>\n      <div class=\"text-block\">\n        <h3>三得利梅酒</h3>\n        <p>这款是三得利旗下的经典梅酒，酸甜爽口，口感愉悦，冰镇后梅酒的口感进一步被激发，再加上一杯苏打水，不论是配餐还是睡前独自都是很好的选择。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[瓶: 明石信威士忌梅酒]</div>\n      <div class=\"text-block\">\n        <h3>明石信威士忌梅酒</h3>\n        <p>女生会喜欢的威士忌梅酒，黄金比例调配，醇厚香甜的酒体，细腻贴口的感。让人很难感受到威士忌的存在，直到喝完后的回甘才发现它们的美的融合在了一起。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[瓶: 蝶矢黑糖梅酒]</div>\n      <div class=\"text-block\">\n        <h3>蝶矢黑糖梅酒</h3>\n        <p>来自冲绳的黑糖与梅酒的完美融合，黑糖里的甘蔗矿物质梅酒带来了独特的芳香甜味，推荐与牛奶一起搭配，口感顺滑醇厚又饱满~</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[包装盒+瓶: 长乐无忧梅酒 TRIANGLE]</div>\n      <div class=\"text-block\">\n        <h3>长乐无忧梅酒</h3>\n        <p>一款国产的优秀梅酒，被超高颜值收到来会尝试，被其他款式的口感存在，清爽宜饮的口感，入口后，浓浓的青梅香一直探到嘴里，这款包装十分健康，即便是正在身材管理的女生也可以放心的饮~</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
